      "description": "dependencies.summary; histogram_approximation; observe-v1.1.3。Web 前端与网关、网关与后端各 RPC 方法的调用频次与执行结果。覆盖 thread/*, turn/*, tasks/*, fs/* 等完整方法名分类。",
